Package: orbit-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Orbit OS builder <root@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), pkexec, fdisk, e2fsprogs, dosfstools,
 ntfs-3g, cryptsetup, squashfs-tools, util-linux, parted, xkb-data, tzdata, locales
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Orbit OS installer
 Installs Orbit OS from the live USB: erase a disk, install next to Windows
 (shrinking it) or into free space, with optional full-disk encryption.
 Live session only: the installer removes itself from the installed system.
